OL,3,GNEWSADoctor who removed ovaries faces
OL,4,Afresh tribunal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe General Medical Council challenged
OL,7,Fthat outcome in the High Court.
OL,9,FAfter hearing the appeal, Mr Justice
OL,10,FMorris found that the tribunal had made
OL,11,Ferrors in relation to five groups of
OL,12,Fallegations.
